# curlbench target profile: amd64.
#
# Plain -O2, no -march: the portable baseline, and what to use when the numbers
# will be published, since anyone can reproduce it. Add -march=/-mtune= here
# only when the point is to match one specific build of one specific image.
#
# amd64 is the least informative of the three profiles for these patches. It is
# out-of-order and wide enough to hide per-byte costs that an in-order arm64 or
# a ppc e300c3 pays in full. Treat a null result here as "this machine cannot
# see it", not as "the patch does nothing" -- and treat a large result here as
# needing confirmation on a smaller core before it is quoted.

CB_HOST=""
CB_CFLAGS="-O2 -g"
CB_CC="${CB_CC:-cc}"
CB_NOTE="amd64, generic -O2"
